/ G_LINE IMPLEMENTATION PLAN — NOT AM1 SOURCE, NOT ASSEMBLABLE
/ Pending confirmation of AM1 calling convention and logical->Type30 transform.
/ Four logical coordinate arguments: X0 Y0 X1 Y1
/ dx=abs(x1-x0); dy=abs(y1-y0)
/ sx=sign(x1-x0); sy=sign(y1-y0)
/ err=dx-dy
/ LOOP: G_PLOT_LOGICAL(x0,y0)
/       if x0=x1 and y0=y1: return
/       e2=err+err
/       if e2 > -dy: err-=dy; x0+=sx
/       if e2 < dx: err+=dx; y0+=sy
/       jump LOOP
/ This plan intentionally avoids inventing unverified AM1 instruction syntax.
